00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:36.600
And then three, what are
some best practices that I

00:00:36.600 --> 00:00:40.560
can employ so that I can have a
successful transfer initiative?

00:00:40.560 --> 00:00:44.140
So those are the three
things we hope to cover here.

00:00:44.140 --> 00:00:46.980
So to start with, I want to talk
a little bit about the mission

00:00:46.980 --> 00:00:48.510
