00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:43.510
Now, most successful
transfer projects

00:02:43.510 --> 00:02:46.660
don't start from
moving your first byte.

00:02:46.660 --> 00:02:49.240
In fact, they start
well before that,

00:02:49.240 --> 00:02:53.330
in constructing a
good transfer plan.

00:02:53.330 --> 00:02:55.780
And with that, I'd like to
invite my colleague, Scott, up

00:02:55.780 --> 00:02:57.970
